OL,3,GNEWSACall handling error led to fatal
OL,4,Adelay, jury finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has changed the
OL,7,Fway its 999 call handlers are trained
OL,8,Fafter officers were sent to the wrong
OL,9,Flocation of a road crash before a
OL,10,Fsubsequent collision in which three
OL,11,Fpeople were killed.
OL,13,FSachin Kalia, 19, Davina Kaur Ruprah,
OL,14,F24, and Kiranjeet Sagoo, 36, died after
OL,15,Fa collision on the A13 in east London
OL,16,Fon 15 July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
