OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall handling error led to fatal
OL,4,Adelay, jury finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury at Walthamstow Coroner's Court
OL,7,Fsaid the fatal crash might have been
OL,8,Favoided had officers been given the
OL,9,Fcorrect location of an earlier incident
OL,10,Fand arrived in sufficient time to clear
OL,11,Fit.
OL,13,FIt also found the deaths were caused
OL,14,Fwhen a driver lost control at high
OL,15,Fspeed in poor weather conditions and
OL,16,Fcrashed with the victims' vehicle.
